Ed25519 private keys and any other exchange credential material live here.

This directory is mounted read-only into the `app` container at /run/secrets and
into nothing else -- Grafana, Prometheus, Loki and Tempo have no reason to see
exchange credentials.

Nothing in here is ever committed. The .gitkeep exists so that the directory is
present on a clean clone with the checkout's own ownership; without it Docker
creates it on first `up` as root, and a root-owned secrets directory is one that
the 0600 key-mode check (SECURITY.md 4.5) later fails on for a confusing reason.

See DEPLOYMENT.md 5.4 for generating the keys.
